{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_entry_mc28_arrow_is_property_of_assumption", "label": "The Arrow Is a Property of the Assumption", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC28.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Composition's matching condition silently identifies electrons placed with electrons present, an assumption about destinations rather than a constraint of counting. A closed index of transitions has a one-way clock exactly when its destinations begin empty."}, {"id": "recovered_entry_mc28_g_big_g_extended_index", "label": "The (g, G) Extended Index (13,775 cells)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC28.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Indexing the sum rather than bounding it: carry g placed and G total after arrival under g \u2264 G \u2264 2(2f+1), g \u2264 q, 2S\u2032 \u2264 G \u2014 all single-parent monotone \u2014 with prior occupancy G \u2212 g derived. The clock does not survive: 31.6 % of 2,620,090 composable pairs raise occupancy."}, {"id": "recovered_entry_mc28_weight_arrows", "label": "One Closed Arrow per Coordinate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC28.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "X_w = {a : w(tgt a) \u2264 w(src a)} is closed for each single-coordinate weight \u2014 shell 9,407, subshell 9,845, occupancy 5,165, spin 7,160, each E = 0 \u2014 while a sum breaks both sides, a maximum breaks meets and a minimum breaks joins. An index does not have a clock; it has one per coordinate."}, {"id": "recovered_entry_mc28_placed_versus_present", "label": "Electrons Placed versus Electrons Present", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC28.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_entry_mc28_arrow_is_property_of_assumption", "target": "recovered_entry_mc27_occupancy_clock", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC28.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_entry_mc28_placed_versus_present", "target": "recovered_entry_mc28_arrow_is_property_of_assumption", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC28.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_entry_mc28_g_big_g_extended_index", "target": "recovered_entry_mc28_placed_versus_present", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC28.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_entry_mc28_weight_arrows", "target": "recovered_entry_mc28_g_big_g_extended_index", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC28.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_entry_mc28_g_big_g_extended_index", "target": "recovered_entry_mc24_admissibility_condition", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC28.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}